    confidence 0.03 scheme="vocabmod-se-confidence@1"
    comment "en" """
        Source L401B SNOMED CT 238612002 = generalized pustular psoriasis of von Zumbusch, Swedish subcode
        of L40.1. The SNOMED CT concept 4243163 (concept_code 38360005) is non-standard (U) and Athena Maps
        to 4031142. Target SNOMED CT 4031142 (concept_code 238612002), standard_concept=S; this is also the
        Athena Maps to target for the parent ICD-10 L40.1. Broader: standard target subsumes the von
        Zumbusch subtype. High tier: crosswalk-verified via the non-standard concept's Maps to edge.
        """
}
