    confidence 0.03 scheme="vocabmod-se-confidence@1"
    comment "en" """
        Source L401C SNOMED CT 238612002 = recurrent circinate erythematous psoriasis (Lapière), a rare
        Swedish subcode of L40.1. SNOMED CT 4033785 (238617008, S) is related but the source is
        erythematous, not pustular, so equivalence is not exact. Target SNOMED CT 4031142 (concept_code
        238612002), standard_concept=S, the Athena Maps to target for parent ICD-10 L40.1. Broader:
        standard target subsumes the source as a parent-category concept. Moderate tier: rare subtype,
        no exact standard target, mapped via parent crosswalk.
        """
}
